{
  "spec": "docs/ui-button-standard.md",
  "comment": "按钮样式标准守卫 policy（guard:button-standard 消费）。四节对应 spec §7/§8/§9 的 BTN-001..004。文件路径一律仓库根相对 POSIX 路径。扫描面：BTN-001/002/003 扫 tsxZones 下 .tsx（排除 __tests__ 与 *.test.*）；BTN-004 扫 btn004Zone 下 .ts/.tsx/.css（排除同上）。packages/ui 包内组件实现天然合法，不在扫描面。",
  "tsxZones": [
    "apps/hub/src",
    "apps/editor/src"
  ],
  "btn004Zone": "apps/editor/src",
  "ignorePaths": [
    "node_modules/**",
    "**/dist/**",
    "**/dist-static/**",
    "**/out/**",
    "**/.next/**",
    "**/build/**",
    "**/coverage/**"
  ],
  "btn001": {
    "comment": "共享 Button className 几何覆写禁令（spec §8）。forbiddenTokenPatterns 逐 token 匹配（响应式前缀 sm:/md: 等先剥离；h-auto/min-h-*/max-h-* 等布局参与类天然不命中 h-\\d）。exemptions 逐文件登记允许的具体 token；文件内出现登记外的违禁 token 仍报红。",
    "forbiddenTokenPatterns": [
      "^h-\\d",
      "^h-\\[",
      "^px-\\[",
      "^py-\\[",
      "^text-\\[",
      "^text-2xs$",
      "^rounded-full$",
      "^size-"
    ],
    "exemptions": [
